      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4222,
      "text": "as a bearer of glad tidings and a warner; yet most of them turn away and they do not listen.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 413,
      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4223,
      "text": "They say, “Our hearts are covered against what you are calling us to; there is deafness in our ears, and there is a barrier between us and you. So carry on [in your way], we will carry on [in our way].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 413,
      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4224,
      "text": "Say [O Prophet], “I am only a human being like yourselves; it has been revealed to me that your god is only One God, so seek the straight path to Him and seek His forgiveness, and woe to those who associate partners with Him,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 413,
      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4225,
      "text": "those who do not give zakah, and who disbelieve in the Hereafter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 413,
      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4226,
      "text": "Those who believe and do righteous deeds, they will have a never-ending reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 413,
      "hizbQuarter": 190,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4227,
      "text": "Say, “Do you disbelieve in the One Who created the earth in two Days[3] and you set up rivals to Him? Such is the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 477,
      "ruku": 414,
      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4228,
      "text": "He placed on it firm mountains standing high above it, showered His blessings upon it, and measured its sustenance totaling exactly four Days[4], for all who ask.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 41,
        "name": "سُورَةُ فُصِّلَتۡ",
        "englishName": "Fussilat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Explained in detail",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
