      "ruku": 414,
      "hizbQuarter": 191,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4229,
      "text": "Then He turned to the heaven when it was all smoke, and said to it and to the earth, ‘Come into being, willingly or unwillingly.’ They both said, ‘We come willingly.’",
